{{box title="Status of this section"}}
One Artifact (AT-01) with one evaluated build, a paper build of the UC01 specification. Two Evaluation Reports: ER-01, a formative cognitive walkthrough with one evaluator pass done, and ER-02, the summative design for EM-02, designed and not run. Seven Evidence entries, all from ER-01 and all resting on reviewer judgement. No primary data has been collected.
{{/box}}

* [[a. Artifacts>>3\. Evaluation.a\. Prototype.WebHome]]: AT-01 Pepper tooth-brushing aid
* [[b. Evaluation Reports>>3\. Evaluation.b\. Test.WebHome]]: ER-01 cognitive walkthrough of UC01; ER-02 within-resident baseline comparison (study design)
* [[c. Evidence>>3\. Evaluation.Evidence.WebHome]]: EV-01 to EV-07

